& [BoundaryFormation] separates five layers
  + [request] is pure validation before FFI
  + [runtime] is target dispatch and one result
  + [seam] is one private Windows module with owned resource discipline
  + [probe] is opt-in exact-root physical observation
  + [scanner] is absent

& [AtomicRequirementSet] is complete
  + [M2B-WPR-001] preserve raw source, research, forms proof, and ABI proof
  + [M2B-WPR-002] create one isolated crate with runtime profile 0.1
  + [M2B-WPR-003] validate the proven request before every possible Windows call
  + [M2B-WPR-004] compile an explicit unsupported-target path without windows-sys on non-Windows
  + [M2B-WPR-005] open only the validated path with exact read-only, sharing, creation, and no-follow flags
  + [M2B-WPR-006] reject INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE before exactly one OwnedHandle transfer
  + [M2B-WPR-007] query FileIdInfo, final GUID path, volume information, and remote protocol in exact order on one handle
  + [M2B-WPR-008] use exact aligned fixed structures and fixed bounded WCHAR buffers
  + [M2B-WPR-009] capture actual Windows errors immediately; emit nonzero OS faults or a distinct zero-error runtime provenance fault
  + [M2B-WPR-010] map length, UTF-16, and semantic failures to local observation faults
  + [M2B-WPR-011] copy complete strong identity, path, volume, remote, and disposition evidence into owned forms
  + [M2B-WPR-012] deny unsafe by default and allow exactly six documented blocks in one private Windows module
  + [M2B-WPR-013] forbid raw-handle escape, CloseHandle, write access, mutating calls, and partial evidence
  + [M2B-WPR-014] provide pure boundary tests and exact static seam assertions
  + [M2B-WPR-015] provide one ignored opt-in fixture probe bound to the exact ignored local root
  + [M2B-WPR-016] preserve physical request, result, host, executable, and artifact digests
  + [M2B-WPR-017] close global verification, audit, evidence, rollback, support, narrative, and publication
  + [M2B-WPR-018] retain scanner, receipt, mutation, seal, launch, and promotion prohibitions

& [RequestAtom] is pre-effect
  + [validation] calls ValidatePlatformPreflightForm before target dispatch
  + [invalid] returns InvalidRequest with no FFI
  + [Windows] requires exact x86_64-pc-windows-msvc target already fixed by the form
  + [input_root] remains caller-owned and canonical

& [RuntimeAtom] is one safe function
  + [function] is observe_platform_preflight
  + [input] is borrowed WindowsPlatformPreflightRequest
  + [success] is one owned WindowsPlatformPreflightRecord
  + [runtime_fault] is InvalidRequest, UnsupportedTarget, or OperatingSystemErrorUnavailable with exact open or query operation
  + [API_fault] remains inside the proven result sum

& [OpenAtom] is exact
  + [access] is FILE_READ_ATTRIBUTES
  + [share] is FILE_SHARE_READ plus FILE_SHARE_WRITE plus FILE_SHARE_DELETE
  + [creation] is OPEN_EXISTING
  + [flags] are FILE_FLAG_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT plus FILE_FLAG_BACKUP_SEMANTICS
  + [security] is null
  + [template] is null
  + [failure] is INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE plus immediate GetLastError
  + [ownership] is one OwnedHandle from_raw_handle transfer after success only

& [QueryAtom] is ordered
  + [Q1] FileIdInfo into aligned MaybeUninit FILE_ID_INFO
  + [Q2] normalized volume-GUID final path into 32768 initialized WCHARs
  + [Q3] volume information into 261-WCHAR label and filesystem buffers plus scalars
  + [Q4] FileRemoteProtocolInfo into aligned MaybeUninit FILE_REMOTE_PROTOCOL_INFO
  + [handle] is borrowed from the same live OwnedHandle for every query
  + [failure] consumes no output bytes

& [TransformationAtom] is provenance preserving
  + [identity] is the 16 FILE_ID_INFO bytes encoded lowercase in returned byte order
  + [path] uses the successful returned character count and strict UTF-16
  + [volume_text] requires a NUL terminator and strict UTF-16
  + [remote_reserved] requires every top-level, generic, and protocol-specific reserved value to be zero
  + [length_fault] is ReturnedLengthLimit
  + [decode_fault] is InvalidUtf16
  + [shape_fault] is InvalidObservation
  + [zero_error_after_API_failure] is OperatingSystemErrorUnavailable and never an invented OS code or query stage
  + [form_gate] validates the final record before release

& [DispositionAtom] is inherited
  + [protocol_nonzero] is RejectRemoteProtocol
  + [protocol_zero_and_NTFS] is EligibleLocalNtfs
  + [other_filesystem] is RejectUnsupportedFileSystem
  + [other_relation] rejects during final form validation

& [UnsafeBudget] is exact
  + [block_1] open and immediate error capture
  + [block_2] ownership transfer
  + [block_3] identity query and immediate error capture
  + [block_4] final-path query and immediate error capture
  + [block_5] volume query and immediate error capture
  + [block_6] remote query and immediate error capture
  + [outside_module] is zero unsafe syntax
  + [unsafe_function] is zero

& [PhysicalProbeAtom] is opt-in
  + [test_state] is ignored by default
  + [runner] requires the exact repository and exact fixture root
  + [fixture_root] is \\?\C:\Project\Cantor\.local\m2b-platform-preflight-fixture
  + [fixture_mutation] is directory plus request and result evidence files under .local only
  + [observation] is read only after fixture creation
  + [expected] is complete local NTFS protocol zero and eligible disposition
  + [unexpected] is preserved and blocks the success claim

& [DataDesignModel] is boundary typed
  + [validated_request] precedes effect
  + [runtime_fault_sum] cannot impersonate an OS fault
  + [result_sum] preserves OS, local, and complete provenance
  + [OwnedHandle] contains resource lifetime
  + [owned_result] contains no pointer, handle, buffer view, or partial record
  + [physical_bundle] binds request, result, host, executable, and source artifacts

& [ConstraintLedger] is fail closed
  + [C-01] only the new crate, workspace membership, local package lock edge, governed runner, tests, and records may change
  + [C-02] existing production crates remain unsafe-forbid and byte-identical except evidence references
  + [C-03] windows-sys stays exact 0.61.2 with the proven three features
  + [C-04] package universe may add only the new local crate and no registry package
  + [C-05] request validation occurs before target dispatch and FFI
  + [C-06] exact call set is CreateFileW, GetLastError, two GetFileInformationByHandleEx classes, GetFinalPathNameByHandleW, and GetVolumeInformationByHandleW
  + [C-07] exact unsafe block count is six
  + [C-08] INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE never enters OwnedHandle
  + [C-09] one raw handle creates one owner and never escapes
  + [C-10] every API failure captures its own immediate error and zero uses the distinct runtime provenance fault
  + [C-11] every local failure uses observation_fault
  + [C-12] every fault contains no partial evidence
  + [C-13] every complete result validates before release
  + [C-14] physical mutation is confined to the exact ignored fixture directory
  + [C-15] default tests perform no physical preflight
  + [C-16] scanner and receipt surfaces remain absent

& [FailureModeSet] is explicit
  + [F-01] invalid request reaches FFI
  + [F-02] non-Windows imports or invokes windows-sys
  + [F-03] open flags grant write or omit no-follow
  + [F-04] invalid raw handle is owned
  + [F-05] handle has zero or multiple owners
  + [F-06] query order or handle identity drifts
  + [F-07] failed output is read
  + [F-08] error capture is delayed or zero is represented as an OS fault or invented query stage
  + [F-09] buffer size, alignment, or lifetime is invalid
  + [F-10] invalid UTF-16 is replaced rather than rejected
  + [F-11] reserved remote fields are ignored
  + [F-12] local fault is mislabeled as an OS fault
  + [F-13] final record bypasses form validation
  + [F-14] unsafe appears outside the one module or exceeds six blocks
  + [F-15] default suite performs the physical call
  + [F-16] probe escapes the exact ignored fixture root
  + [F-17] physical unexpected outcome is normalized
  + [F-18] runtime proof is cited as scanner or receipt authority

& [VerificationProgram] is ordered
  + [V-01] verify source, prior proofs, host preconditions, and signed authority
  + [V-02] verify exact workspace, dependency, and lock delta
  + [V-03] test invalid request and unsupported target before the seam
  + [V-04] test pure UTF-16, identity, reserved, disposition, and result mapping
  + [V-05] statically assert exact call names, flags, unsafe blocks, safety comments, and forbidden names
  + [V-06] run focused debug and overflow-checked release without physical opt-in
  + [V-07] compile and run the exact ignored fixture probe only through the governed runner
  + [V-08] preserve exact physical request, output, host, source, and executable digests
  + [V-09] run full debug and release, format, lint, build, docs, and audit
  + [V-10] regenerate evidence and close solution, proof, review, readiness, narrative, reentry, and publication

& [SemanticRefinementTrace] is exact
  + [runtime] means bounded translation from one validated request to one proven result or one closed runtime-layer provenance fault
  + [unsafe] means six auditable FFI or ownership operations, not general permission
  + [read_only] means no write access and no mutating API; fixture creation is a separate runner authority
  + [physical_success] means only the bound result observed on the named host and fixture
  + [complete] means every profile 0.2 field validates

& [ConstraintCheckTrace] is grounded
  + [Microsoft] fixes call signatures, return shapes, path flags, volume buffers, and remote structure meaning
  + [Rust] fixes FromRawHandle preconditions and OwnedHandle destructor responsibility
  + [generated_bindings] fix the exact ABI items and constants
  + [prior_forms_proof] fixes every released result shape and relation
  + [prior_ABI_proof] fixes dependency version, features, layouts, and no-call baseline

& [PruningTrace] removes overreach
  + [pruned] tree traversal and content reads
  + [pruned] stream, attribute, standard-info, and case-sensitive queries
  + [pruned] retry, dynamic allocation growth, and partial evidence
  + [pruned] direct CloseHandle and raw-handle API
  + [pruned] automatic physical execution
  + [pruned] candidate, scanner, receipt, mutation, seal, launch, and promotion

& [FoldTrace] is seven-fold
  + [fold_1_intent] make one honest physical root observation
  + [fold_2_terms] request, runtime fault, OS fault, local fault, complete, and physical proof are distinct
  + [fold_3_relations] one owner and one ordered query chain bind every result
  + [fold_4_constraints] calls, flags, buffers, blocks, files, fixture, and effects are closed
  + [fold_5_failures] eighteen invalidation paths are explicit
  + [fold_6_verification] ten ordered proof gates are explicit
  + [fold_7_nonclaims] no scanner, receipt, candidate, launch, or promotion authority exists

